   "hash": "bc3b80ea72575c20",
   "does": "Clears the active-session state between recordings, except while a night's ending is in progress (StreamingLifecycle.isEndingOvernight), when it logs a warning and changes nothing: currentSession, collectedPoints, verificationResult, recoveryWindow, needsAcceptance, lastError (the Record screen alerts on a change of error, so a dismissed one left in place hid the next identical one), isCollecting, isStreamingMode, sessionStartTime, reviewArchivedSessionId, baselineDeviation, recordingPhase .idle, isPaused false, pausedSession nil, then clears the persisted paused-session state only when a paused session was being reset.",
